        "link": "https://thehill.com/newsletters/whole-hog-politics/whole-hog-politics-live-briefing/5911534-graham-platner-controversy-steve-hilton-california-spencer-pratt-la-live-discussion/",
        "orario": "14:24",
        "timestamp": 1780662293,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Maine Senate hopeful Graham Platner (D) is facing fresh scrutiny after a report from The New York Times detailed new allegations from women about his past behavior in relationships. He has pushed back on the most serious claims and brushed off suggestions he would withdraw from the race. In California, former Fox News host Steve..."
